Experience the refined character of Amahle Cabernet Sauvignon Wine 750 mL, a South African vintage crafted from handpicked harvests of the Western Cape. This 2024 Cabernet Sauvignon delivers a balanced profile where rich flavor and aroma come together in harmony, reflecting the grape&#x2019;s natural heritage. With its smooth body and well-structured taste, it offers a simple yet elegant wine experience that highlights classic Cabernet Sauvignon notes. Perfect for pairing with hearty meals or enjoying on special occasions.
&#xD;
&#xD;
Crafted from handpicked South African harvests&#xD;
Cabernet Sauvignon 2024 vintage from Western Cape&#xD;
Balanced flavor profile with rich aroma and smooth body&#xD;
Expresses classic Cabernet Sauvignon character&#xD;
Alcohol content: 13% ABV&#xD;
750 mL bottle size&#xD;
&#xD;
Storage Instructions:&#xA0;Store in a cool and dry place.

Tenute Rubino Marmorelle Bianco 2016&#xA0;is a refined Southern Italian blend of Chardonnay and Malvasia, offering a fresh and vibrant expression of Salento terroir. It features an elegant bouquet of tropical and citrus fruits, including passion fruit, peach, lemon, and apple, layered with delicate floral notes. Light-bodied with lively acidity, it delivers a smooth, balanced, and mineral-driven finish that enhances its refreshing character. Perfect for pairing with seafood, poultry, and light dishes, it is a versatile and sophisticated choice for any occasion.
&#xD;
&#xD;
White wine blend of Chardonnay and Malvasia from Southern Italy&#xD;
Fresh, fruity profile with citrus and tropical notes&#xD;
Light-bodied with lively acidity and mineral finish&#xD;
Smooth, well-balanced, and aromatic complexity&#xD;
Ideal with seafood, poultry, and light dishes&#xD;
&#xD;
Grape Variety: Chardonnay, Malvasia
&#xD;
Region: Salento, Italy
&#xD;
Alcohol by Volume: 13.5%
&#xD;
Serving Suggestion:&#xA0;Serve at 8-10&#xB0;C.
&#xD;
Allergen Information: Contains sulfites.

Enjoy the refreshing taste of Cape Sweet White Wine 750 mL, a quality blended sweet white wine from South Africa&#x2019;s renowned Western wine region. Made from carefully selected grapes, this wine features a fruity aroma, delicate sweetness, and a smooth finish enhanced by the cool mountain breezes of the region. Its light and easy-drinking character makes it ideal for casual gatherings, celebrations, or pairing with light meals and desserts. Best served chilled for a crisp and enjoyable wine experience.
&#xD;
&#xD;
Quality blended sweet white wine from South Africa&#xD;
Fruity aroma with a smooth and refreshing finish&#xD;
Crafted from selected grapes from the Western wine region&#xD;
Light, sweet, and easy-drinking flavor profile&#xD;
Best served chilled&#xD;
Alcohol content: 8.5% ABV&#xD;
Convenient 750 mL bottle size&#xD;
&#xD;
Storage Instructions:&#xA0;Store in a cool and dry place.

Walsh Blue Curacao Liqueur 750mL
&#xD;
&#xD;
Blue Curacao is a sweet blue liqueur, distilled and flavored from the dried peel of bitter oranges. It can also contain distillates of lemons and curacao fruit, sugar, and wine. The Caribbean island of Curacao is host to much of the fruit used in these liqueurs.

Paulaner M&#xC3;&#x192;&#xBC;nchner Hell is a perfect balance of malty character and the light bitterness of the hops. Its flavor makes it one of the world's favorite beers.
&#xD;
&#xD;
Ingredients: Water, Barley malt, Hops, and Yeast.

