Discover Circumstance Cape Coral Mourvedre 750mL, a refined ros&#xE9; crafted by Waterkloof in Stellenbosch, South Africa. Made from 100% Mourvedre grown on ocean-facing slopes, this wine reflects meticulous craftsmanship with low-yield bush vines and traditional winemaking techniques. Its pale coral hue reveals delicate aromas of red currant and raspberry, leading to a fresh yet textured palate with a long, savory finish. Elegant and versatile, it pairs beautifully with seafood, grilled dishes, and refined cuisine.
&#xD;
