100% Mourvedre rose crafted by Waterkloof in Stellenbosch&#xD;
Ocean-facing bush vines with low-yield, high-quality grapes&#xD;
Pale coral color with red berry aromas of currant and raspberry&#xD;
Fresh, textured palate with a long, savory finish&#xD;
Wild-yeast fermented in traditional wooden vessels&#xD;
Alcohol content: 12.5% ABV&#xD;
750mL bottle size&#xD;
&#xD;
Storage Instructions:&#xA0;Store in a cool and dry place.

&#xD;
&#xD;
 Vanilla highlights and rose petal aromas complement the ripe plum, blackberry and cherry flavors. &#xD;
&#xD;
 Toasty oak and barrel spice wrap up with a soft, silky and lingering finish. &#xD;
