Bacardi 8-Year Old Rum&#xA0;is a complex golden rum with many flavors that unravel when drinking it.&#xA0;

Originally developed by Don Facundo in 1862, it was kept as the private reserve of the Bacardi family during more than 130 years.

Its flavor is mellow, wooden, and with rich vanilla, clove, nutmeg&#xA0;and dried fruit spices. Designed to be enjoyed straight or with ice.

Crows Gin 750mL

Crows Gin is a beautiful citrus-forward contemporary style gin. While it's admittedly a little light on the juniper. In fact, the Juniper is at best a supporting note throughout the palate. However, the combination of everything, juniper included, results in a nicely balanced but unabashedly contemporary style gin. It's one of the most exciting citrus-forward gins. Beautiful and balanced, Crows Gin is Highly Recommended in its category.

&#xA0;

Enjoy the vibrant taste of Carlo Rossi Pink Moscato Sweet Wine, a blend that perfectly balances sweetness and freshness. This light-bodied pink sangria offers fruity notes of peach and orange, complemented by the floral essence of Moscato. With its smooth finish and refreshing flavor, it's ideal for casual gatherings or as a chilled treat on warm days. Perfectly pairs with fruits, cheeses, and fresh salads.
&#xD;
&#xD;
Light-bodied and fruity pink Moscato sangria&#xD;
Notes of juicy peach and citrusy orange&#xD;
Smooth, refreshing, and easy to drink&#xD;
Perfect for pairing with fruits, salads, and cheeses&#xD;
Great for sharing and celebrations&#xD;

Chateau Soussans is the second wine of Chateau Deyrem Valentin and is managed by the famous Jean Sorge whose family have owned the estate since the 18th century. Sorge combines tradition and innovation in equal measure to produce classic Margaux. They benefit from an exceptional terroir and modern winemaking methods.

Chateau Soussans Margaux is made with 50% Cabernet Sauvignon and 50% Merlot the wine is soft and silky with perfumed strawberry jam on the nose.
Ripe plum and cream come through on the palate which has supple tannins and an attractive, lively red fruit finish.
This elegant Margaux will be lovely to drink, share and enjoy over the next decade.

&#xA0;

&#xA0;

Enjoy the refreshing taste of BioMio Organic Red Sangria 750mL, a Spanish sangria crafted from organic Tempranillo grapes and infused with natural extracts of orange, lemon, and cinnamon. This light-bodied sangria delivers vibrant flavors of tart cherry and citrus zest for a smooth and fruity drinking experience. Made in Spain by Bodegas Valdepablo, it is certified organic, non-GMO, gluten-free, vegan, and free from pesticides. Perfect for casual gatherings, celebrations, or serving chilled on warm occasions.
&#xD;
