Crafted with organic Tempranillo grapes&#xD;
Infused with natural orange, lemon, and cinnamon extracts&#xD;
Refreshing light-bodied sangria with tart cherry and citrus zest flavors&#xD;
Organic, non-GMO, gluten-free, and vegan&#xD;
Made in Spain by Bodegas Valdepablo&#xD;
Convenient 750mL bottle size&#xD;
&#xD;
Alcohol by Volume:&#xA0;6.5%
&#xD;
Storage Instructions:&#xA0;Store in a cool and dry place.

Delight in the refreshing sweetness of Woomera White Moscato Wine, a pale, lively wine bursting with tropical and citrus flavors. Its bouquet reveals ripe peach, guava, and a hint of citrus&#x2014;classic notes of the Muscat grape. On the palate, it offers a luscious blend of pineapple and tangerine balanced by a crisp acidity for a perfectly zesty finish. Ideal for pairing with light desserts or enjoyed chilled on its own.
&#xD;
&#xD;
Pale and lively white Moscato with tropical fruit notes&#xD;
Aromas of ripe peach, guava, and citrus&#xD;
Sweet flavors of pineapple and tangerine balanced by bright acidity&#xD;
Perfect for pairing with desserts or served chilled&#xD;
&#xD;
Alcohol by Volume:&#xA0;8.1%
&#xD;
Allergen Information:&#xA0;Produced using milk/egg products. Some traces may remain.
&#xD;
Note:&#xA0;Contains sulfites.

Enjoy the vibrant taste of Luis The Marinero Red Sangria, a ruby-red Spanish sangria crafted with rich wine aromas and natural fruit notes. It blends the sweetness of blueberries and cherries with hints of citrus and cinnamon for a perfectly balanced flavor. Soft, sweet, and refreshingly smooth on the palate, this sangria is ideal for any celebration or casual gathering. Serve chilled for a truly enjoyable experience.
&#xD;
