Ruby-red sangria with aromas of red berries and citrus&#xD;
Infused with notes of blueberry, cherry, and cinnamon&#xD;
Smooth, sweet, and refreshing on the palate&#xD;
Perfect for parties, picnics, or casual get-togethers&#xD;
&#xD;
Alcohol by Volume:&#xA0;6%

