Born Rose Wine with Box is a vibrant and expressive rose crafted from Grenache Noir and a touch of Tempranillo, offering a refreshing profile. It displays a pale rose petal hue with bluish reflections and an aromatic bouquet of citrus, tropical fruits, and delicate floral notes. On the palate, it is smooth and slightly sweet, with flavors of mango, grapefruit, and passion fruit balanced by a light acidity and a long, fruity finish. Elegantly presented with a box, it's perfect as an aperitif or paired with light dishes and seafood.
&#xD;
